      "en": "They sent to me four times like this; and I answered them the same way.",
      "ko": "저희가 네번이나 이같이 내게 보내되 나는 여전히 대답하였더니",
      "source_text_hash": "ecb8caa248418579ba0784e6f4a9822cdbb676afd7c5b7c16416448396679541",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb4abc7a2e3beaf5603eab2681398c1ee690da1725180cf320745b2c19ea723f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희가 네번이나 이같이 내게 보내되 나는 여전히 대답하였더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cb4abc7a2e3beaf5603eab2681398c1ee690da1725180cf320745b2c19ea723f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NEH:6:5",
      "sequence": 12407,
      "chapter_label": "NEH 6",
