      "en": "For there were many in Judah sworn to him because he was the son-in-law of Shecaniah the son of Arah; and his son Jehohanan had taken the daughter of Meshullam the son of Berechiah as wife.",
      "ko": "도비야는 아라의 아들 스가냐의 사위가 되었고 도비야의 아들 여호하난도 베레갸의 아들 므술람의 딸을 취하였으므로 유다에서 저와 동맹한 자가 많음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "70884f192992650e5d5c204bf695072e6ad87ae0a8d39e0fe5a02be32ce8b6eb",
      "translation_text_hash": "67c9c281f37fe0ecf809aa1f91da8ad6d94a3ed91c688dca090ef68862d1dfc0",
